== A1/A2 cache-role semantics ==
A1 cache POST inm=* exists=true (RFC9111 MUST NOT evaluate) -> {"decision": "412", "precondition": "if_none_match"}
A1b origin POST inm=* exists=true                          -> {"decision": "412", "precondition": "if_none_match"}
A2 cache GET ims=500 lastmod=null (RFC9111 Date fallback)  -> {"decision": "200", "precondition": null}
A2b origin GET ims=500 lastmod=null                        -> {"decision": "200", "precondition": null}
A2c cache GET inm='"1"' etag='"1"' exists=true (304 vs serve stored) -> {"decision": "304", "precondition": "if_none_match"}
== A3 whitespace around the star ==
A3 if_match=' * ' (strip->star?)                           -> {"decision": "200", "precondition": null}
A3b if_match='*' exists=true                               -> {"decision": "200", "precondition": null}
A3c if_match=' "1" ' exists=false                          -> {"decision": "412", "precondition": "if_match"}
== A4 empty list members (RFC9110 5.6.1.2 MUST accept) ==
A4 if_none_match='"a",, "b"'                               -> REFUSED: empty list member
A4b if_none_match='"a",' (trailing empty)                  -> REFUSED: empty list member
A4c if_none_match='"a" , , "b"'                            -> REFUSED: empty list member
== A5 empty whole value ==
A5 if_match='' (empty string)                              -> REFUSED: empty precondition field value
A5b if_match=' ' (whitespace only)                         -> REFUSED: empty precondition field value
== A6 precondition label on 200 after a passed precondition ==
A6 if_match ok + inm no-match -> 200 label?                -> {"decision": "200", "precondition": null}
A6b if_match no-match -> 412                               -> {"decision": "412", "precondition": "if_match"}
== A12 role=null ==
A12 role=null                                              -> REFUSED: input is not an object
A12 role=null (explicit)                                   -> REFUSED: role is not origin or cache
A12b role absent                                           -> {"decision": "412", "precondition": "if_match"}
== A20 options/trace: RFC9110 13.2 MUST ignore ==
A20 method=OPTIONS inm='"1"' (RFC: ignore -> 200)          -> {"decision": "412", "precondition": "if_none_match"}
A20b method=TRACE inm='"1"'                                -> {"decision": "412", "precondition": "if_none_match"}
A20c method=CONNECT im='"2"'                               -> {"decision": "412", "precondition": "if_match"}
== obs-text / etagc vs RFC 8.8.3 (%x21 / %x23-7E / obs-text) ==
A21 etag with U+0080 obs-text                              -> REFUSED: malformed entity-tag
A21b etag with U+00E9                                      -> REFUSED: malformed entity-tag
== negative epoch date (pre-1970 HTTP-date) ==
A22 if_modified_since=-1                                   -> REFUSED: if_modified_since is neither null nor a non-negative int
A22b last_modified=-1                                      -> REFUSED: last_modified is neither null nor a non-negative int
